  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Friend Of The Devil** (1 review): Reviewer predicted this song when the band switched to acoustic instruments [4]\n- **China Cat Sunflower** (1 review): The China Cat into I Know You Rider pairing after He's Gone sent the reviewer into a frenzy [4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If I Had The World To Give**: rare: 9 archived performances [6]\n- **A Hard Rain's A-Gonna Fall**: rare: 9 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2018-06-04.mk41.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 178 min [1]\n- **dac2018-06-04.mg.m20mp6.flac**: source not stated; 16 songs; 175 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [2]\n- **dac2018-06-04.AKGmix.flac16**: source not stated; 16 songs; 177 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer's first-ever show; they drove down from Cleveland, listening to several other shows on the way [4]\n- Reviewer happened to be visiting family in Cincinnati and decided to catch this show [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2018-06-04.mk41.flac16**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk41 (DINa) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/48) [1]\n- **dac2018-06-04.mg.m20mp6.flac**: taped by Ted Gakidis; transferred by Ted Gakidis; source: Microtech Gefell M20> nBob actives > PFA > Sound Devices MixPre-6(24/48) [2]\n- **dac2018-06-04.AKGmix.flac16**: taped by Toaste; transferred by Toaste; source: DFC lawn, stand at head height > 2x AKG391 cardioids ORTF and 2x AKG393 hypercardioids pointed at stacks > Zoom F8 @ 44.1kHz/16-bit (4-track) > .wav > SDXC [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by tela.sugarmegs.org: [Sugarmegs Audio Setlist](https://tela.sugarmegs.org/_asxtela/asxcards/DeadAndCompany2018-06-04RiverbendMusicCenterCincinnatiOH.html) [7]",
